            "actual_first_word": "identify",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              201.93,
              202.57
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 28,
        "en": "In contrast, passive learners may read the text and listen to lectures and even understand most of what is read and heard, but they do not take that crucial next step of actually thinking about it.",
        "at": "but they do not",
        "zh": [
          "相比之下，被动学习者可能也读文章、听讲座，甚至理解大部分读到和听到的内容，",
          "但他们没有迈出至关重要的下一步：真正思考这些内容。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "but they do not",
